      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Laʻilaʻi será madre de mucha gente. El canto dice: «El hombre se extendió, el hombre ya estaba aquí».",
          "en": "Laʻilaʻi will become the mother of many people. The chant says: \"Man spread abroad, man was here now.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "En el Kumulipo, todo nace de algo anterior, uno detrás de otro. Nadie moldea nada con las manos.",
          "en": "In the Kumulipo, everything is born from something before it. Nobody shapes anything by hand."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero otras tradiciones hawaianas lo cuentan distinto. En ellas, tres dioses moldean al primer hombre con tierra.",
          "en": "But other Hawaiian traditions tell it differently. In them, three gods shape the first man out of earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Qué piensas tú? ¿Los primeros humanos nacieron de la noche, o fueron moldeados con las manos?",
          "en": "What do you think? Were the first people born from the night, or shaped by hand?"
        },
        {
          "es": "La próxima vez: hechos de tierra roja.",
          "en": "Next time: Made from Red Earth. Three gods, a hillside of red clay, and a first breath."
        }
      ],
